.TH PROFILE 2
.SH NAME
profile \- interactive radial-structure model interface
.SH DESCRIPTION
A profile model maps controls to two fields sampled along radius. The shared
client computes the complete profile, plots both normalized fields, and
recomputes immediately when boundary conditions or constitutive parameters
change.
